    "body": "Benchmarks don't need mock-specific behaviour (overridden `Filename()`, `Format()`, or the exposed batch-level `WriteKey()`). Replace `CreateMockableWalletDatabase()` with `MakeInMemoryWalletDatabase()` across all 7 call sites in `src/bench/` (6 files - 5 wallet bench files + 1 in coin_selection), using the same in-memory SQLite path that production code uses.\r\n\r\nFor `coin_selection.cpp` and `wallet_migration.cpp`, which had no other dependencies on `wallet/test/util.h`, also switch the include to `<wallet/sqlite.h>`.\r\n\r\nFollow-up suggested in #35655.",
